<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>曾士宸｜個人介紹</title>

    <style>
        
{
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
          box-sizing: border-box;}

        body {
            font-family: Arial, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa, #e4ecf5);
            color: #222;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        nav {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
            margin-left: 25px;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 85vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }
.hero-content {
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 72px;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-content h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            background: #222;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #555;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .about {
            background: white;
            padding: 80px 10%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .about p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            line-height: 2;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content h1 {
                font-size: 48px;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Tseng Shih-Chen</div>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#home">首頁</a>
            <a href="#about">關於我</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">

            <h1>曾士宸</h1>

            <h2>Hello, I'm Shih-Chen</h2>

            <p>
                歡迎來到我的個人網站。<br>
                延畢的可憐大五學生。
            </p>

            <a href="#about" class="btn">
                認識我
            </a>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">

        <h2>關於我</h2>

        <p>
            嗨，我是曾士宸。<br><br>

            我喜歡探索不同的事物，也持續學習與成長。
            希望透過這個網站，分享我的生活、興趣以及屬於我的故事。
        </p>

    </section>

</body>
</html>
